  "observations": [
    "Western and fan views show short surface ground escapes and extended In1/In6 fields, with mounting holes and isolated return boundaries retained.",
    "Timeout detail shows the three-segment In2 replacement, the healed In1 reference area and ground transition stitches at its existing endpoint vias. Native full-net coverage finds no missing reference on the timeout net.",
    "The input detail shows the E_U37 ground via connected to In1/In4/In6, with clearance rings in the In2/In3 DC-input sheets. The numerical sheet comparison is conditional and is not a current or thermal rating.",
    "All new paths and 2288 retained reference cases pass the native-copper audit. Four pre-existing connector-end reference gaps remain on other surveyed nets. Large numbers of unrouted pads remain."
  ],
